`UNSUPPORTED_CONTAINER_LINK`.

After: `task-board validate` → **Board is valid. No issues found.**

- Cycles: 0, confirmed by an independent DFS over the live `blockedBy` graph of
  all 397 elements (`.temp/TASK-260728-3a2dnr/board-graph-after.json`).
- Unsupported container links: removed with the sanctioned
  `task-board repair-links --confirm` workflow (30 edges). This removes only
  stored container links; task-level dependencies and all evidence are
  untouched, and `plan()` still derives cross-story/cross-epic ordering from the
