# Serial wave plan — macOS prototype autonomous critical path

Produced by `TASK-260728-3a2dnr` on 2026-07-28 from the repaired board.
Regenerate from the live board; do not hand-edit wave contents.

## Shape

```
Wave 0   autonomous prep      1 task   define the Apple identifier/entitlement matrix
Ceremony C1                   human    one up-front permission session on this Mac
Waves 1-15                    auto     131 tasks -> WORKING macOS CLIENT
Waves 16-26                   auto     71 tasks  -> M2 relay/UDP, M3 resilience, M4 macOS release prep
Hold H2                       human    macOS physical M1 validation (real app system-VPN approval)
Deferred branch               human    Gate A0 -> iOS targets -> TestFlight/App Review
```

Total contiguous autonomous work after Ceremony C1: **202 tasks in 26 waves**,
with zero further human permission required until Hold H2. `max_parallel` is 1,
so waves are a partial order for scheduling; execution is strictly serial and a
wave is simply the set that becomes eligible at the same depth.

## Wave 0 — autonomous prep (must precede the ceremony)

- `TASK-260715-ypo7yo` define-apple-identifier-and-entitlement-matrix

  The ceremony cannot ask a human to authorize App IDs, entitlements, and
  profiles that have not been named yet. This task defines all four bundle
  identifiers (both iOS ones stay defined but unprovisioned), the Network
  Extension packet-tunnel entitlement, App Group identifiers, Keychain access
  groups, and profile classes. It no longer waits on `apc34w`; portal
  provisioning (`3jloqy`) does.

## Ceremony C1 — the one up-front human permission session

See `TASK-260728-3a2dnr_ceremony-c1.md` for the exact script. Board tasks it
satisfies, in order:

1. `TASK-260715-apc34w` verify-relux-works-apple-account-readiness
2. `TASK-260715-3jloqy` provision-app-ids-capabilities-and-development-profiles (macOS identifiers only)
3. `TASK-260715-1r0fxv` build-disposable-macos-packet-tunnel-probe (agent builds; human stays present)
4. `TASK-260715-9yp8to` verify-p0-on-physical-apple-silicon-mac (the system-VPN approval click)
5. `TASK-260717-ziprhs` generate-and-install-sparkle-eddsa-update-signing-secret
6. The human half of `TASK-260715-3gkwn0`: `notarytool store-credentials` into a **named** Keychain profile

